text = "[b]DESCRIPTION:[/b]
Primary lift carriage remains stalled on the 1st floor level. The call button on the monitor base does not respond to user input.

[b]DIAGNOSIS:[/b]
The signal wire connecting the call button console to the winding drum was severed during crate transit. A physical conductor wire must be routed to complete the circuit.

[b]SAFETY NOTICE:[/b]
Do not enter the shaft while power bus is energized."

